subject_definitions:
<Subject 1> — 钱经理: a 45-year-old male property manager. Slightly overweight, slicked-back oily hair, round face, an ingratiating smile that flips into a scowl, white shirt buttoned up to the closed collar under a dark grey buttoned waistcoat, dark grey trousers and black leather shoes. His voice is loud, nasal and bullying, standard Mandarin. It is the person shown in <Picture 1>.
<Subject 2> — 苏小满: a 25-year-old female cleaner. Preserve her exact face, small lean build, centre-parted black hair in a low practical ponytail, plain dark-navy button-up work shirt buttoned up to the closed collar with its own small plain buttons down the front, a worn grey apron over dark navy trousers, black cloth shoes. Her voice is low, steady and slightly hoarse, standard Mandarin. It is the person shown in <Picture 2>.
<Subject 3> — 小唐: a 22-year-old female cleaning-team colleague. Thin, pale, narrow shoulders, shifty sidelong eyes, hair tied back in a low ponytail, light-grey button-up work shirt with a pointed collar and matching light-grey trousers, a light-grey apron tied round her waist, black cloth shoes. Her voice is small, thin and nervous. It is the person shown in <Picture 3>.

<Picture 4>: the office layout reference for 万山大厦 — this same single room is the set for the whole clip. Light-oak storage cabinets along the back-left wall with plain brown cardboard boxes stacked on top; a low wooden credenza under the back window with a printer, files and two potted green plants; an L-shaped wooden office desk with a black monitor, keyboard and document tray in the middle of the room, a black swivel chair pushed in; a grey fabric sofa with wooden armrests and a low wooden coffee table under the long window on the right; an open doorway with a grey metal frame on the left. Pale grey polished tile floor, white acoustic ceiling with recessed light panels.

summary:
[reference generation] The cleaner turns the accusation back on the witness; the girl retreats into her own certainty.

retention_analysis:
<Subject 1> — 钱经理: fully_preserved - his slicked-back oily hair, round face, heavy-lidded eyes, broad nose and heavy jaw stay identical in every shot, and he is the only man in the clip.
<Subject 2> — 苏小满: fully_preserved - her slim high-cheekbone face, almond eyes, straight nose and long centre-parted black hair tied into one low practical ponytail at the nape stay identical in every shot.
<Subject 3> — 小唐: fully_preserved - her small round face with full soft cheeks, wide-set round eyes, short flat nose, small closed mouth, thin neck and narrow sloping shoulders stay identical in every shot, and she stays clearly a different person from 苏小满 in face shape, in height and in the light grey of her uniform against 苏小满's dark navy.
<Picture 4>: fully_preserved - light-oak cabinets, L-shaped desk, grey sofa on the right, doorway on the left

detailed_description:
HORIZONTAL 4:3 landscape framing, high-key commercial cinematography, soft broad daylight, luminous pale walls, refined natural faces. Keep the film texture, natural lighting, every face, every costume and the realistic motion consistent throughout. People stay standing, framed from the knees up. The camera is locked off for the whole clip: the framing never changes and the size of everything in frame stays the same from the first frame to the last. All movement comes from the people inside the fixed frame.
Exposure: a large window is the key light and soft bounced daylight fills the room; skin tones are bright and even, shadows sit in the light mid-tones, the whites stay white, and the picture carries an even high-key brightness from edge to edge. Every shirt is buttoned to the closed collar, so each chest shows one unbroken run of plain fabric with small plain buttons; apron bibs are plain.
Speaker labels for this shot only: (S1) 钱经理, (S2) 苏小满, (S3) 小唐. Anyone not named here stays silent with a closed mouth.
The whole clip takes place in the one office shown in <Picture 4>, and the three of them hold these same standing places from the first frame to the last: 钱经理 (S1) behind the L-shaped desk in the middle of the room, three-quarters to the camera; 苏小满 (S2) at the near left corner of that desk in right profile facing right towards him, both feet flat on the tile; 小唐 (S3) on the right side of the room beside the grey sofa in left profile, facing left towards the desk.

ONE CONTINUOUS TAKE, medium three-shot on 钱经理 (S1), 苏小满 (S2) and 小唐 (S3) across the L-shaped desk, framed from the knees up, camera locked off for all ten seconds: 钱经理 (S1) stands behind the L-shaped desk in white shirt and dark waistcoat, his body square to the desk and his head turned slightly right towards 苏小满 (S2) at the near left corner of it, his palm flat on the wood and his jaw set hard; he then swings his chin round towards the doorway at frame left and speaks two short lines one after another in the same loud nasal Mandarin, his mouth opening wide on each: 钱经理 (S1) speaks with his mouth opening wide as he shouts: [Chinese] 你今天把话说清楚。 钱经理 (S1) speaks with his mouth opening wide as he calls out to her: [Chinese] 小唐。看清楚了，再说。 苏小满 (S2) stands at the near left corner of the desk in right profile facing right towards him, both feet flat on the tile, her jaw tightening once and her mouth staying closed the whole time; 小唐 (S3) stands beside the grey sofa at frame right in left profile facing left towards the desk, her eyes cast down at the floor and her fingers pressed on the sofa's wooden arm, staying exactly where she stands with her mouth closed the whole time. The framing never changes once: the same three people stay visible in the same three places at the same size from the first frame to the last, and the open doorway at frame left shows only the corridor wall beyond it.

⚠ The clip is shot as one single unbroken take with no cuts at all: the camera never cuts away, never changes lens, never changes height, and never changes framing, and no split screen or picture-in-picture appears. No slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no camera moves, and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.

overall_soundscape: A clock ticking on the wall and the low hum of the ceiling lights throughout; a hard knuckle tap on the desk top at 1.2s; one small shoe step at 4.0s; room tone returns at 7.0s.

non_diegetic_music: A low sustained string drone begins at 0s, a single wood-block knock lands at 1.3s with the knuckle tap, and one held cello note sustains from 5.0s.
